    "raw": "# Design System: tkt\n\nSelf-hosted service desk. Operator-first density, no marketing theater.\n\n## 1. Typography\n- Primary: Geist (UI)\n- Mono: Geist Mono (IDs, metadata, labels, numeric data)\n\nType scale: 56 display metric / 34 page title / 28 setup title / 24 dialog title / 20 empty-state title / 17 section / 14 body / 13 table title / 12 label / 11 metadata / 10 caps header (letterSpacing 1.2-1.6).\n\n## 2. Color Tokens\nThe OpenPencil document uses literal hex colors (this editor runtime does not resolve `$--refs` in paint). The token table below is the implementation contract: map each token to a CSS variable 1:1. Dark values are demonstrated in the \"Taste — Tickets Dark\" preview screen.\n\n| Token | Light | Dark |\n|---|---|---|\n| bg | #ECEFF3 | #16181D |\n| surface | #F8FAFC | #1E2128 |\n| surface-2 | #F1F3F6 | #242830 |\n| surface-3 | #F7F8FA | #1A1D23 |\n| shell | #DDE2EA | #2A2F38 |\n| ink | #111318 | #0F1115 |\n| primary | #315EFF | #4D7BFF |\n| on-primary | #F8FAFC | #F8FAFC |\n| primary-soft | #E8EEFF | #22304E |\n| primary-shell | #CBD7FF | #232C42 |\n| danger | #B42318 | #FF6B60 |\n| danger-soft | #FEE4E2 | #3A2326 |\n| warning | #8A5A00 | #FFB95C |\n| warning-soft | #FFF1D6 | #3A2F1E |\n| success | #18734D | #4ADE9B |\n| success-soft | #E2F2EA | #1F332B |\n| overlay | #FFFFFF22 | #FFFFFF22 |\n| rail-active | #F8FAFC12 | #F8FAFC12 |\n| skeleton | #E5E8ED | #262B33 |\n| border | #D3D8E0 | #333A45 |\n| border-strong | #D6DBE3 | #333A45 |\n| border-row | #E3E6EB | #2A2F38 |\n| text | #111318 | #EDF0F4 |\n| text-2 | #242830 | #D3D9E2 |\n| text-3 | #4E5663 | #A6AFBC |\n| text-muted | #5F6875 | #8B94A3 |\n| text-faint | #6B7482 | #7A8392 |\n\n## 3. Components\n- Shell pattern: 4px outer frame (shell, radius 20) wrapping an inner card (radius 16, surface). Used for queue, login card, composer, transitions.\n- Buttons: pill (radius = height/2), primary with arrow/+ island (overlay), dark action ink.\n- Status pills: 26px, radius 13, soft fill + strong text. new=primary-soft/primary, in progress=warning-soft/warning, resolved=success-soft/success.\n- Priority: critical=danger, high=warning, medium=text-muted (mono labels).\n- Inputs: 48px, radius 12, surface on border, placeholder text-muted.\n\n## 4. Verified product claims (no smoke)\n- 5 states, 8 legal transitions (internal/domain/state.go). No \"5x5\" claim.\n- 10 tickets per page (PageSize).\n- Sessions expire 24h after creation (fixed TTL, not inactivity).\n- Every mutation audited (append-only); reopen-from-closed requires a reason.\n- No password length rule yet: setup form does NOT claim \"minimum 8 characters\".\n\n## 5. Screens\nLogin, Tickets, Ticket Detail, Users, Categories, Setup, New Ticket + queue states: Empty, Empty Search, Loading skeleton, Error, and Tickets Dark (dark preview).",
